    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: voice\n\nAnswers calls to every organization's number. Each keypress makes one trip to Supabase, which checks the call really comes from Twilio (token in Supabase Vault) and answers it, so the caller waits as little as possible.\n\nNo passwords in this workflow. After pasting: open **Handle Call**, make sure the Supabase credential is picked, then **Publish**.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
